      <p><seg source="#source-519-558">只今戦争相すみ候処、然るに</seg><seg type="annotated-text" source="#source-564-624"><seg source="#source-558-564">岩弥</seg><note type="gloss"><seg source="#source-588-609">（岩崎弥太郎）</seg></note></seg><seg source="#source-624-627">、</seg><seg type="annotated-text" source="#source-633-690"><seg source="#source-627-633">佐栄</seg><note type="gloss"><seg source="#source-657-675">（佐々木栄）</seg></note></seg><seg source="#source-690-732">兼て御案内の通りに、兵機も無</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-732-744">レ</note><seg source="#source-744-759">之候へば無</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-759-771">二</note><seg source="#source-771-777">余儀</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-777-789">一</note><seg source="#source-789-816">敗走に及び候。独り</seg><seg type="annotated-text" source="#source-819-876"><seg source="#source-816-819">菅</seg><note type="gloss"><seg source="#source-840-861">（菅野覚兵衛）</seg></note></seg><seg source="#source-876-879">、</seg><seg type="annotated-text" source="#source-885-936"><seg source="#source-879-885">渡辺</seg><note type="gloss"><seg source="#source-909-921">（剛八）</seg></note></seg><seg source="#source-936-1050">の陣、敵軍あへて近寄り能はず、唯今一とかけ合はせは仕り候。当る所ひらき申候。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1050-1074"><rb>竊</rb><rt>（ひそか）</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1074-1173">に思ふ、富国強兵、且雄将のはたらき、東夷皆イウタンを落し申さんと奉</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-1173-1185">レ</note><seg source="#source-1185-1196">存候。</seg></p>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-1196-1264" style="padding-inline-start: 3em">
        <p><seg source="#source-1217-1226">卯九月</seg><seg type="layout" source="#source-1226-1264" rend="chitsuki align(right) offset-from-end(3)" snh:layout-kind="chitsuki" snh:layout-params="align=right;offset-from-end=3"><seg source="#source-1256-1264">梅拝</seg></seg></p>
      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-1264-1300" style="padding-inline-start: 2em">
        <p><seg source="#source-1285-1300">佐々木先生</seg></p>
      </div>
    </body>
